---
/**
 * Ulpiano CCO — Judicial Backend API Console View (FastAPI Python 3.12)
 * Interactive Cryptographic Simulator for Legal Tech Compliance
 */
---

<section id="view-api" class="py-4 py-lg-5" style="display: none;">
  <div class="container-xxl px-3">
    <!-- Hero Banner -->
    <div
      class="legal-hero-card mb-4"
      style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 60%, #0369a1 100%); color: #ffffff;"
    >
      <div class="legal-breadcrumb text-white-50">
        <a href="#" onclick="window.UlpianoDash?.switchView('dashboard')" class="text-white-50">
          Portal CCO
        </a>
        <span class="mx-1">/</span>
        <span class="text-white-50">Arquitectura Desacoplada</span>
        <span class="mx-1">/</span>
        <span class="text-white">Servidor API en Python 3.12 (FastAPI)</span>
      </div>

      <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center justify-content-between gap-4">
        <div>
          <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="badge bg-primary px-3 py-1">
              <i class="devicon-python-plain colored me-1"></i> Python 3.12 Core
            </span>
            <span class="badge bg-teal px-3 py-1" style="background-color: #009688;">
              <i class="devicon-fastapi-plain colored me-1"></i> FastAPI + uvloop
            </span>
            <span class="badge bg-dark px-3 py-1 border border-secondary">
              OpenAPI 3.1 REST &amp; WSS
            </span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="legal-hero-title text-white mb-2">
            Consola Interactiva del Backend Judicial en Python
          </h1>
          <p class="legal-hero-desc text-white-50 mb-0">
            El servidor en <strong>Python 3.12 (FastAPI ASGI)</strong> gestiona la lógica
            criptográfica forense, firma digital avanzada SUSCERTE (PyKCS11 HSM FIPS 140-2 L3 y
            pyHanko), tareas Celery/Redis, persistencia pgvector y almacenamiento inmutable en
            Bóveda WORM de MinIO conforme a la LMDyFE y la Ley de Infogobierno.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="d-flex gap-2 align-self-start">
          <button
            class="btn btn-warning text-dark fw-bold px-3 py-2 d-inline-flex align-items-center gap-2"
            onclick="window.UlpianoDash?.switchDiagramTab('backend_python'); window.UlpianoDash?.switchView('diagrams');"
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 1.15rem;">
              schema
            </span>
            <span>Ver Diagrama Backend</span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Interactive Simulators Grid -->
    <div class="row g-4 mb-5">
      <!-- Sim 1: Firma Digital PAdES-B-LTA -->
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
        <div class="dc3-card dc3-card-accent-top h-100 d-flex flex-column justify-content-between">
          <div>
            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3">
              <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                <span class="api-method-post">POST</span>
                <span class="fw-bold font-monospace text-primary">
                  /api/v1/sentencias/firmar-pades
                </span>
              </div>
              <span class="dc3-tag dc3-tag-gold">LMDyFE Arts. 4, 6, 8</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-muted small mb-3">
              Simula la firma electrónica avanzada mancomunada de una resolución judicial mediante{' '}
              <code>pyHanko</code>, token criptográfico HSM PKCS#11 FIPS 140-2 Nivel 3 y sellado de
              tiempo TSA RFC 3161.
            </p>
            <div class="row g-2 mb-3">
              <div class="col-md-6">
                <label class="form-label small fw-bold">Número de Causa / Expediente:</label>
                <input
                  type="text"
                  id="sim-sign-exp"
                  class="form-control form-control-sm"
                  value="EXP-TSJ-SC-2026-0406"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="col-md-6">
                <label class="form-label small fw-bold">Tribunal / Sala:</label>
                <select id="sim-sign-court" class="form-select form-select-sm">
                  <option value="Sala Constitucional TSJ">Sala Constitucional TSJ</option>
                  <option value="Sala Político-Administrativa">Sala Político-Administrativa</option>
                  <option value="Sala de Casación Penal">Sala de Casación Penal</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div class="col-md-6">
                <label class="form-label small fw-bold">Magistrado / Juez Ponente:</label>
                <input
                  type="text"
                  id="sim-sign-judge"
                  class="form-control form-control-sm"
                  value="Dr. Jull Ortiz — Magistrado"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="col-md-6">
                <label class="form-label small fw-bold">Algoritmo Criptográfico:</label>
                <input
                  type="text"
                  class="form-control form-control-sm bg-light"
                  value="RSA-4096 / SHA3-512 (HSM L3)"
                  readonly
                />
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <button
              class="btn btn-dark btn-sm fw-semibold w-100 mb-2 d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center gap-1"
              onclick="window.UlpianoDash?.simulateSignDocument()"
            >
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 1rem;">
                draw
              </span>
              <span>Firmar Electrónicamente con PyKCS11 &amp; pyHanko</span>
            </button>
            <div id="sim-sign-result" class="api-response-viewer" style="display:none;"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Sim 2: Cotejo Universal CSV / QR -->
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
        <div class="dc3-card dc3-card-accent-green h-100 d-flex flex-column justify-content-between">
          <div>
            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3">
              <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                <span class="api-method-get">GET</span>
                <span class="fw-bold font-monospace text-success">
                  /api/v1/sentencias/cotejo/{`{csv}`}
                </span>
              </div>
              <span class="dc3-tag dc3-tag-green">Infogobierno Art. 27</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-muted small mb-3">
              Verifica la autenticidad e integridad inmutable de una sentencia en la Bóveda WORM de
              MinIO S3 mediante su Código Seguro de Verificación (CSV) y cotejo de hash dual.
            </p>
            <div class="mb-3">
              <label class="form-label small fw-bold">Código Seguro de Verificación (CSV):</label>
              <div class="input-group input-group-sm">
                <input
                  type="text"
                  id="sim-cotejo-input"
                  class="form-control font-monospace"
                  value="TSJ-2026-SC-0406-V12-F9A7"
                />
                <button class="btn btn-success" onclick="window.UlpianoDash?.simulateCotejo()">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined me-1" style="font-size:1rem;">
                    verified
                  </span>{' '}
                  Cotejar en Bóveda
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="d-flex gap-2 mb-3">
              <button
                class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm"
                onclick="document.getElementById('sim-cotejo-input').value='TSJ-2026-SC-0406-V12-F9A7'; window.UlpianoDash?.simulateCotejo();"
              >
                Ejemplo Válido (WORM Locked)
              </button>
              <button
                class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm"
                onclick="document.getElementById('sim-cotejo-input').value='TSJ-2026-INVALID-0000'; window.UlpianoDash?.simulateCotejo();"
              >
                Ejemplo Alterado/Inválido
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="sim-cotejo-result" class="api-response-viewer" style="display:none;"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Sim 3: Sorteo Criptográfico Imparcial de Causas -->
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
        <div class="dc3-card dc3-card-accent-gold h-100 d-flex flex-column justify-content-between">
          <div>
            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3">
              <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                <span class="api-method-post">POST</span>
                <span class="fw-bold font-monospace text-dark">
                  /api/v1/sorteo/distribuir-causa
                </span>
              </div>
              <span class="dc3-tag dc3-tag-red">Título VII Art. 26</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-muted small mb-3">
              Asignación determinística e imparcial de ponencia judicial mediante CSPRNG
              criptoseguro (<code>secrets.SystemRandom</code>) con registro inmutable en Árbol de
              Merkle.
            </p>
            <div class="row g-2 mb-3">
              <div class="col-md-6">
                <label class="form-label small fw-bold">Número de Causa:</label>
                <input
                  type="text"
                  id="sim-sorteo-causa"
                  class="form-control form-control-sm"
                  value="CAUSA-ADM-2026-8841"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="col-md-6">
                <label class="form-label small fw-bold">Materia de la Causa:</label>
                <select id="sim-sorteo-materia" class="form-select form-select-sm">
                  <option value="Amparo Constitucional Ciberseguridad">
                    Amparo Constitucional Ciberseguridad
                  </option>
                  <option value="Demanda Nulidad Acto Administrativo">
                    Demanda Nulidad Acto Administrativo
                  </option>
                  <option value="Delitos Informáticos y Fraude Procesal">
                    Delitos Informáticos y Fraude Procesal
                  </option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <button
              class="btn btn-warning text-dark fw-bold btn-sm w-100 mb-2 d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center gap-1"
              onclick="window.UlpianoDash?.simulateSorteo()"
            >
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 1rem;">
                casino
              </span>
              <span>Ejecutar Sorteo Criptoseguro Imparcial</span>
            </button>
            <div id="sim-sorteo-result" class="api-response-viewer" style="display:none;"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Sim 4: Feed de Alertas Tempranas IA Ética (ISO 42001) -->
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
        <div class="dc3-card dc3-card-accent-red h-100 d-flex flex-column justify-content-between">
          <div>
            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3">
              <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                <span class="api-method-ws">WSS</span>
                <span class="fw-bold font-monospace" style="color: #7c3aed;">
                  /api/v1/compliance/stream
                </span>
              </div>
              <span class="dc3-tag dc3-tag-gold">ISO 42001 &amp; CGR</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-muted small mb-3">
              Canal WebSocket bidireccional que emite telemetría y alertas procesales en tiempo real
              hacia la Oficina CCO y los órganos de control (CGR/SUNAI/Inspectoría).
            </p>
            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-2">
              <span class="small fw-bold text-dark">Canal de Alertas en Vivo:</span>
              <span class="badge bg-success">
                <span
                  class="spinner-grow spinner-grow-sm me-1"
                  style="width: 0.5rem; height: 0.5rem;"
                ></span>{' '}
                WSS Conectado
              </span>
            </div>
            <div id="sim-ws-feed" class="api-response-viewer mb-3" style="max-height: 160px;">
              <div class="text-white-50 small">
                [SYS] Conexión WSS establecida con Python ASGI uvloop...
              </div>
              <div class="text-success small">
                [INFO 14:32:01] Token HSM verificado: Certificado Raíz SUSCERTE válido.
              </div>
              <div class="text-warning small">
                [ALERT 14:33:14] Causa EXP-2026-0112 próxima al límite legal del Art. 257 CRBV.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <button
              class="btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm w-100 d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center gap-1"
              onclick="window.UlpianoDash?.simulateTriggerAnomaly()"
            >
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 1rem;">
                notification_important
              </span>
              <span>Simular Detección de Anomalía Procesal</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- OpenAPI 3.1 Endpoint Catalog -->
    <div class="dc3-card p-4">
      <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-2">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">menu_book</span>
        <span>Catálogo de Endpoints OpenAPI 3.1 (Swagger REST Contract)</span>
      </h5>
      <p class="text-muted small mb-4">
        Contrato oficial de comunicación tipada entre el cliente <strong>Next.js 15</strong> y el
        servidor backend en <strong>Python 3.12 (FastAPI)</strong>:
      </p>

      <div class="table-responsive">
        <table class="table table-hover align-middle mb-0">
          <thead class="table-light">
            <tr>
              <th style="width: 90px;">Método</th>
              <th>Ruta del Endpoint</th>
              <th>Módulo Backend Python</th>
              <th>Fundamento Jurídico</th>
              <th>Autenticación &amp; Autorización</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="small font-monospace">
            <tr>
              <td>
                <span class="api-method-post">POST</span>
              </td>
              <td>
                <strong>/api/v1/auth/token</strong>
              </td>
              <td class="font-sans">FastAPI OAuth2 + WebAuthn FIDO2</td>
              <td class="font-sans text-danger">LPCDI Art. 9</td>
              <td>
                <span class="badge bg-secondary">Público / PKCE</span>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>
                <span class="api-method-post">POST</span>
              </td>
              <td>
                <strong>/api/v1/sentencias/firmar-pades</strong>
              </td>
              <td class="font-sans">PyKCS11 HSM + pyHanko PDF/A-2u</td>
              <td class="font-sans text-primary">LMDyFE Arts. 4, 6, 8</td>
              <td>
                <span class="badge bg-primary">Bearer JWT (Juez/Secretario)</span>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>
                <span class="api-method-get">GET</span>
              </td>
              <td>
                <strong>/api/v1/sentencias/cotejo/{`{csv}`}</strong>
              </td>
              <td class="font-sans">Bóveda WORM S3 + Hash Dual SHA-256</td>
              <td class="font-sans text-success">Infogobierno Art. 27</td>
              <td>
                <span class="badge bg-success">Acceso Público Universal</span>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>
                <span class="api-method-post">POST</span>
              </td>
              <td>
                <strong>/api/v1/sorteo/distribuir-causa</strong>
              </td>
              <td class="font-sans">secrets.SystemRandom + Merkle Log</td>
              <td class="font-sans text-danger">Título VII Art. 26</td>
              <td>
                <span class="badge bg-primary">Doble Firma 4-Ojos</span>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>
                <span class="api-method-get">GET</span>
              </td>
              <td>
                <strong>/api/v1/compliance/alertas-tempranas</strong>
              </td>
              <td class="font-sans">Motor IA Ética CCO (ISO 42001)</td>
              <td class="font-sans text-warning text-dark">LOCOTA Art. 11 &amp; CGR</td>
              <td>
                <span class="badge bg-dark">Oficial CCO / Inspectoría</span>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>
                <span class="api-method-get">GET</span>
              </td>
              <td>
                <strong>/api/v1/rag/buscar-normativa</strong>
              </td>
              <td class="font-sans">LlamaIndex + pgvector (Postgres 16)</td>
              <td class="font-sans text-info text-dark">CRBV Art. 28 (Habeas Data)</td>
              <td>
                <span class="badge bg-primary">Bearer JWT</span>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>
                <span class="api-method-ws">WSS</span>
              </td>
              <td>
                <strong>/api/v1/compliance/stream</strong>
              </td>
              <td class="font-sans">FastAPI WebSockets + Redis 7 Pub/Sub</td>
              <td class="font-sans text-primary">FISMA § 3554 Live DOV</td>
              <td>
                <span class="badge bg-primary">WSS Auth Token</span>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
